From 5f7d6de742a72089c0f8dbe383ec7617f733ae3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:42:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add initial hacky setup for QEMU RISC-V Buildroot that boots into Weston

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
---
